      "type": "LinguisticObject",
      "content": "Cecilia Beaux, New York, and Gloucester, MA, from 1898 to 1922; the Art Institute of Chicago, 1922.",
      "classified_as": [
        {
          "id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435438",
